    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it’s easy to say that, but it doesn't feel true. the version of me that people knew, the version that actually mattered... that person is gone. they burned that person down. even if i keep living, i'm just a shell walking around pretending things are normal. it feels like i'm just haunting my own life at this point.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
