      "content": "but what is the point of \"having a voice\" when everything i say just makes things worse? the world has already made its verdict. i look at my life and i see a ghost. it's like i'm stuck in this limbo where i'm socially dead but physically forced to keep dragging this corpse of a reputation around. wouldn't it just be more honest if the outside actually matched the inside?",
